<title>USA: Blimpie sees lower Q2 EPS of $0.07-0.08.</title>
<headline>Blimpie sees lower Q2 EPS of $0.07-0.08.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Blimpie International Inc Friday said it expected to reported second-quarter share earnings of $0.07-0.08, lower than the year ago's $0.11 a share.</p>
<p>It said complete financial results for the period will be released February 7.</p>
<p>The company attributed the weaker results to higher expenditures related to the expansion of its franchising activities overseas and, as expected, lower revenue recognized from the sales of U.S. franchises and subfranchises.</p>
</text>
